#. Short description.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Expose and inspect WordPress Abilities API capabilities for AI hosts and clients, without running models or writing content."
msgstr "为 AI host 和客户端暴露并检查 WordPress Abilities API 能力，不运行模型，也不写入内容。"

#. Plugin name.
#, gp-priority: high
msgid "Npcink Abilities Toolkit"
msgstr "Npcink Abilities Toolkit"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Read-only host composition recipe metadata may document how hosts can compose abilities, but those records do not run queues, schedule jobs, execute workflows, or create a second registry. Host composition recipe metadata is available through read-only helpers and Abilities API discovery abilities for hosts that need catalog discovery without execution ownership."
msgstr "只读的宿主组合配方元数据可以说明宿主如何组合能力，但这些记录不会运行队列、安排任务、执行工作流或建立第二套注册表。需要发现能力目录、但不拥有执行职责的宿主，可以通过只读辅助函数和 Abilities API 发现能力获取这些元数据。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Every write-like ability is a preview by default. A real change only happens after your host product approves the commit, and the approval decision and the audit trail stay with the host, never with this plugin."
msgstr "所有写入类能力默认只提供预览。只有宿主产品批准并提交操作后，才会发生实际变更；审批决定和审计记录始终由宿主管理，不由本插件保存。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Npcink Abilities Toolkit gives your WordPress site a safe toolbox for AI clients: an AI assistant or host product can read articles, media, comments, menus, and site diagnostics, and prepare reviewed suggestions for tags, excerpts, and media metadata."
msgstr "Npcink Abilities Toolkit 为您的 WordPress 站点提供供 AI 客户端使用的安全工具集：AI 助手或宿主产品可以读取文章、媒体、评论、菜单和站点诊断信息，并准备供您审阅的标签、摘要和媒体元数据建议。"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "A one-time welcome notice on the Plugins screen links to the status page. Open Tools -&gt; AI Ability Set (or Npcink AI -&gt; AI Ability Set when a Npcink AI host menu is present) and check that the site ability status is working."
msgstr "插件页面的一次性欢迎通知会链接到状态页面。打开工具 -&gt; AI 能力集；如果存在 Npcink AI 宿主菜单，则打开 Npcink AI -&gt; AI 能力集，并确认站点能力状态正常。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "After activation, open Tools -&gt; AI Ability Set to see at a glance what AI clients can do on this site: which abilities are available, which are read-only, and which would require approval from a host product before anything changes. The page is built for site operators first."
msgstr "启用后，打开工具 -&gt; AI 能力集，即可查看 AI 客户端在此站点能做什么：哪些能力可用、哪些只读，以及哪些操作在发生变更前需要宿主产品批准。页面优先面向站点管理人员设计。"


#. Found in faq header.
msgid "What does uninstalling remove?"
msgstr "卸载会删除哪些内容？"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "To expose abilities from your own plugin, register them on plugins_loaded through the public helpers listed under Public API; see the Third-Party Integration Quickstart below."
msgstr "若要公开您自己插件的能力，请在 plugins_loaded 阶段通过公共 API 中列出的辅助函数注册；详见下方第三方集成快速入门。"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Confirm the site runs WordPress 6.9 or later so the Abilities API registration functions and REST routes exist."
msgstr "确认站点运行 WordPress 6.9 或更高版本，以提供 Abilities API 注册函数和 REST 路由。"

#. Found in installation list item.
msgid "Install and activate the plugin through the Plugins screen, or upload the plugin folder to wp-content/plugins/ and activate it from there."
msgstr "通过插件页面安装并启用，或者将插件文件夹上传至 wp-content/plugins/ 后在该页面启用。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Source-level verification commands for contributors are documented in the public repository's README and CONTRIBUTING files."
msgstr "贡献者使用的源代码验证命令见公开仓库的 README 和 CONTRIBUTING 文件。"

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Connection view under Developer Tools: copyable REST endpoint values, raw discovery fetches, and ability ID export."
msgstr "开发者工具中的连接视图：可复制的 REST 端点地址、原始发现响应和能力 ID 导出。"

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Checks view under Developer Tools: read-only checks explained before running, summary results, and raw responses kept behind a support disclosure."
msgstr "开发者工具中的检查视图：运行前说明只读检查的作用，显示结果摘要，并将原始响应收起供支持排查时展开。"

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Ability Catalog view under Developer Tools: searchable catalog with filters, risk grouping, availability, and technical details for support."
msgstr "开发者工具中的能力目录视图：可搜索的目录，包含过滤条件、风险分组、可用状态和供支持排查使用的技术详情。"

#. Screenshot description.
msgid "Overview tab: site ability status tiles, the ability package list with write safeguards, plain-language capability groups, and next actions."
msgstr "概览标签页：站点能力状态、具有写入保护的能力包列表、易于理解的能力分组及后续操作。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "The page is designed for site operators first: it shows site ability status, the ability package list with write safeguards, plain-language capability groups, and next actions. Under Developer Tools, the Checks view can run two official read-only checks: site info and bounded redacted diagnostics summary, explaining what each check proves and what it does not prove before it runs. Check results are shown as a plain summary table, with raw JSON kept behind a support disclosure. The Connection view keeps copyable REST endpoint values, raw discovery fetches, and ability ID export available for host/client setup. It does not run showcase workflows, model calls, write abilities, approval flows, or demo abilities. The Tools -&gt; AI Ability Set page remains the standalone surface when no Npcink AI host menu is active; host detection must not create approval, quota, audit, or workflow control-plane behavior in this plugin."
msgstr "页面优先面向站点管理人员设计，提供站点能力状态、能力包列表和写入保护、易于理解的能力分组及后续操作。开发者工具中的检查视图可运行两个官方只读检查：站点信息和范围受限的脱敏诊断摘要；运行前会说明每项检查能证明什么、不能证明什么。检查结果显示为简明摘要表，原始 JSON 收起供支持排查时展开。连接视图提供可复制的 REST 端点地址、原始发现响应和能力 ID 导出，用于宿主或客户端配置。它不会运行演示工作流、模型调用、写入能力、审批流程或示例能力。在没有 Npcink AI 宿主菜单时，工具 -&gt; AI 能力集仍为独立安装的入口；宿主检测不得在本插件内建立审批、配额、审计或工作流控制层。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "The workflow definition helpers return read-only recipe metadata for host-side composition. They are not a workflow registry, execution engine, scheduler, approval store, audit store, model router, prompt registry, or final write authority."
msgstr "工作流定义辅助函数返回供宿主组合使用的只读配方元数据，不是工作流注册表、执行引擎、调度器、审批存储、审计存储、模型路由器、提示词注册表或最终写入授权方。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "The <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/upload-media-from-url</code> ability is inert as a dry-run preview unless a separate authenticated host supplies approval context and commits the operation. When an approved host runtime commits that ability, WordPress sends an HTTP request to the caller-provided URL in order to fetch the media file for the local media library. The remote endpoint is chosen by the caller, not by this plugin. This plugin stores no provider credentials or remote-service configuration for that ability. This is not provider routing, cloud execution, or stored external-service configuration."
msgstr "<code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/upload-media-from-url</code> 能力在预演预览时不执行实际操作；只有独立且已认证的宿主提供审批上下文并提交操作后才会执行。已批准的宿主运行时提交该能力时，WordPress 会向调用者提供的 URL 发出 HTTP 请求，获取媒体文件并存入本地媒体库。远程端点由调用者选择，不由本插件选择。本插件不为该能力存储服务提供商凭据或远程服务配置。这不是服务提供商路由、云端执行或已保存的外部服务配置。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Bundled starter locale files are limited to translations intentionally maintained in this repository. Incomplete bundled locale packs are removed until they can be maintained as complete starter translations. WordPress.org directory translations are managed separately through translate.wordpress.org/GlotPress and are not runtime authority owned by this plugin."
msgstr "内置初始语言包仅包含本仓库有意维护的翻译。不完整的内置语言包会暂时移除，直到能够作为完整的初始翻译维护。WordPress.org 插件目录翻译单独通过 translate.wordpress.org/GlotPress 管理，不是本插件拥有的运行时权威来源。"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "WordPress 6.9 or later. WordPress 6.9 introduced the Abilities API used by this plugin."
msgstr "WordPress 6.9 或更高版本。本插件使用的 Abilities API 自 WordPress 6.9 引入。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "The WordPress Abilities API routes must be available before clients can discover and run abilities. Enable the WordPress Abilities API baseline or compatibility plugin for the target site."
msgstr "在客户端可以发现和运行 abilities 之前，WordPress Abilities API routes 必须可用。请为目标站点启用 WordPress Abilities API 基线或兼容插件。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "Open Tools -&gt; AI Ability Set, or Npcink AI -&gt; AI Ability Set when a Npcink AI host menu is present. Use the Checks tab to confirm safe read-only responses, then use Available Abilities to review what the site exposes. Developers and host products can use Developer Access for REST endpoint values and raw discovery responses."
msgstr "打开 Tools -&gt; Site AI Abilities；如果存在 Npcink AI host 菜单，则打开 Npcink AI -&gt; AI Abilities。使用 Checks tab 确认安全的只读响应，然后使用 Available Abilities 查看站点暴露了哪些能力。开发者和 host 产品可以在 Developer Access 中获取 REST endpoint 值和 raw discovery responses。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "No. The diagnostics summary intentionally omits Npcink AI settings, MCP settings, API keys, database names, table prefixes, filesystem paths, error logs, and external HTTP probes."
msgstr "不会。Diagnostics summary 会有意省略 Npcink AI 设置、MCP 设置、API keys、数据库名、table prefix、filesystem paths、error logs 和 external HTTP probes。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "Site Info proves that an authorized ability client can read basic WordPress site information. Redacted Diagnostics proves that the site can return a support-friendly environment summary with sensitive fields omitted. These checks do not call models, generate content, contact external services, or fix configuration automatically."
msgstr "Site Info 证明已授权的 ability client 可以读取基础 WordPress 站点信息。Redacted Diagnostics 证明站点可以返回适合支持排查的环境摘要，并省略敏感字段。这些检查不会调用模型、生成内容、联系外部服务，也不会自动修复配置。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "No. Npcink AI is an optional consumer. The plugin can also be used by other plugins or clients that consume the WordPress Abilities API."
msgstr "不需要。Npcink AI 是可选消费者。这个插件也可以被其他消费 WordPress Abilities API 的插件或客户端使用。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "No. The admin page checks are read-only. Some built-in abilities describe write-like or destructive operations, but final commits require a host runtime with its own approval, authorization, and audit layer."
msgstr "不会。后台页面检查都是只读的。部分内置 abilities 会描述类似写入或破坏性的操作，但最终 commit 需要 host runtime 自己提供审批、授权和 audit 层。"

#. Found in faq paragraph.
msgid "No. Npcink Abilities Toolkit exposes WordPress abilities and support information through the WordPress Abilities API. Model routing, prompt selection, hosted runtime execution, and workflow execution belong to a separate host product or client."
msgstr "不会。Npcink Abilities Toolkit 通过 WordPress Abilities API 暴露 WordPress abilities 和支持信息。模型路由、prompt 选择、托管 runtime 执行和 workflow 执行属于独立的 host 产品或客户端。"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "What if the wp-abilities/v1 REST routes are missing?"
msgstr "如果缺少 wp-abilities/v1 REST routes 怎么办？"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "What should I do if abilities are not visible to a host product or AI client?"
msgstr "如果 host 产品或 AI client 看不到 abilities，我应该怎么做？"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Does Redacted Diagnostics expose secrets?"
msgstr "Redacted Diagnostics 会暴露 secrets 吗？"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "What do the Safe Checks prove?"
msgstr "Safe Checks 能证明什么？"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Do I need Npcink AI to use this plugin?"
msgstr "使用这个插件需要 Npcink AI 吗？"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Will this plugin change my posts, media, terms, comments, or settings by itself?"
msgstr "这个插件会自行修改我的 posts、media、terms、comments 或 settings 吗？"

#. Found in faq header.
msgid "Does this plugin run AI models?"
msgstr "这个插件会运行 AI 模型吗？"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "If the <code>wp-abilities/v1</code> REST routes are missing, enable the WordPress\nAbilities API baseline or compatibility plugin before connecting third-party\nproviders or clients."
msgstr "如果缺少 <code>wp-abilities/v1</code> REST routes，请在连接第三方 provider 或客户端之前，启用 WordPress Abilities API 基线或兼容插件。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Full provider examples and REST client notes are maintained in the public\nrepository:"
msgstr "完整的 provider 示例和 REST client 说明维护在公开仓库中："

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "The contract endpoint is a compatibility and boundary discovery endpoint for\nauthenticated host runtimes. It does not replace the WordPress Abilities API\ncatalog and does not run abilities."
msgstr "Contract endpoint 是面向已认证 host runtime 的兼容性和边界 discovery endpoint。它不会替代 WordPress Abilities API catalog，也不会运行 abilities。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "REST clients should first discover the catalog through:"
msgstr "REST 客户端应该先通过以下地址发现 catalog："

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Use <code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_register_readonly()</code> for read-only context and\ndiagnostic abilities. Use <code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_register_write_proposal()</code>\nonly when the callback returns a proposal, preview, diff, or handoff payload.\nThird-party provider callbacks should not perform final host-governed commits.\nApproval, audit, quota, and final write authorization belong to the consuming\nhost runtime."
msgstr "只读上下文和诊断 abilities 应该使用 <code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_register_readonly()</code>。只有当 callback 返回 proposal、preview、diff 或 handoff payload 时，才使用 <code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_register_write_proposal()</code>。第三方 provider callback 不应该执行最终的 host-governed commit。审批、audit、额度和最终写入授权属于消费方 host runtime。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Do not include files from this plugin's <code>includes/</code> directory or instantiate\nclasses in the <code>Npcink_Abilities_Toolkit</code> namespace. Those are implementation\ndetails."
msgstr "不要 include 本插件 <code>includes/</code> 目录下的文件，也不要实例化 <code>Npcink_Abilities_Toolkit</code> namespace 里的类。那些都是实现细节。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Provider plugins should wait until <code>plugins_loaded</code>, check that the public\nhelper exists, and then register their abilities through the helper functions:"
msgstr "Provider 插件应该等待 <code>plugins_loaded</code>，检查 public helper 是否存在，然后通过 helper 函数注册自己的 abilities："

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "The plugin does not run AI models, execute workflows, route prompts, contact model providers, manage billing or quotas, own MCP governance, or approve final WordPress writes."
msgstr "它不会运行 AI 模型、执行 workflow、路由 prompt、联系模型提供商、管理计费或额度、拥有 MCP 治理，也不会审批最终的 WordPress 写入。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "For developers and host runtimes, the plugin also provides ability registration helpers, category helpers, schema normalization, annotation normalization, REST discovery values, and optional canonical projection for Npcink AI when Npcink AI is installed."
msgstr "对于开发者和 host runtime，插件也提供能力注册 helper、分类 helper、schema 规范化、annotation 规范化、REST discovery 值，以及在安装 Npcink AI 时可选的 Npcink AI canonical projection。"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "<code>/wp-json/npcink-abilities-toolkit/v1/contract</code>"
msgstr "<code>/wp-json/npcink-abilities-toolkit/v1/contract</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "<code>/wp-json/wp-abilities/v1/abilities/{namespace}/{name}/run</code>"
msgstr "<code>/wp-json/wp-abilities/v1/abilities/{namespace}/{name}/run</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "<code>/wp-json/wp-abilities/v1/abilities</code>"
msgstr "<code>/wp-json/wp-abilities/v1/abilities</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "<code>/wp-json/wp-abilities/v1/categories</code>"
msgstr "<code>/wp-json/wp-abilities/v1/categories</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "The WordPress Abilities API REST routes must be available before third-party\nprovider plugins or external clients can discover and run abilities."
msgstr "在第三方 provider 插件或外部客户端发现并运行 abilities 之前，WordPress Abilities API REST routes 必须可用。"

#. Found in description header.
msgid "Third-Party Integration Quickstart"
msgstr "第三方集成快速开始"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "<code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_get_workflow_definitions()</code>"
msgstr "<code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_get_workflow_definitions()</code>"

#. Found in description list item.
msgid "<code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_get_registered()</code>"
msgstr "<code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_get_registered()</code>"

#. Found in description header.
msgid "Admin Page"
msgstr "后台页面"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Core governance handoff docs include a catalog snapshot, permission matrix, and schema boundary audit for hosts that consume this plugin through <code>npcink-ai-core</code>."
msgstr "Core governance handoff 文档包含 catalog snapshot、permission matrix 和 schema boundary audit，供通过 <code>npcink-ai-core</code> 消费本插件的 host 使用。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "It also includes <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/list-workflow-recipes</code> and <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/get-workflow-recipe</code>, read-only host composition recipe metadata discovery abilities. These expose metadata only and do not execute workflow runtime behavior."
msgstr "它也包含 <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/list-workflow-recipes</code> 和 <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/get-workflow-recipe</code>，这是只读的 host composition recipe metadata discovery abilities。它们只暴露 metadata，不执行 workflow runtime behavior。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "It also includes <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/search-posts</code> and <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/search-post-meta</code>, bounded local WordPress search helpers for keyword and explicit post-meta discovery. These are read-only helpers and do not call external search indexes or mutate content."
msgstr "它也包含 <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/search-posts</code> 和 <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/search-post-meta</code>，用于 keyword 和明确 post-meta discovery 的有边界本地 WordPress search helpers。这些都是只读 helper，不会调用外部 search index，也不会修改内容。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "It also includes <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/wp-diagnostics-summary</code>, a redacted WordPress-only diagnostics summary for Abilities API clients. This summary intentionally omits Npcink AI settings, MCP settings, API keys, database names, table prefixes, filesystem paths, error logs, and external HTTP probes."
msgstr "它也包含 <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/wp-diagnostics-summary</code>，这是面向 Abilities API client 的、只包含 WordPress 信息的 redacted diagnostics summary。该摘要会有意省略 Npcink AI 设置、MCP 设置、API keys、数据库名、table prefix、filesystem paths、error logs 和 external HTTP probes。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "The plugin includes migrated low-risk WordPress read abilities, deterministic comment helpers, and host-governed WordPress write/destructive abilities using canonical <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/*</code> ids."
msgstr "插件包含迁移后的低风险 WordPress read abilities、确定性的 comment helpers，以及使用规范 <code>npcink-abilities-toolkit/*</code> ids 的 host-governed WordPress write/destructive abilities。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "After activation with a Npcink AI host plugin, open Npcink AI -&gt; AI Ability Set in wp-admin. When this standalone package is installed without a Npcink AI host menu, open Tools -&gt; AI Ability Set instead."
msgstr "与 Npcink AI host 插件一起启用后，在 wp-admin 中打开 Npcink AI -&gt; AI Abilities。单独安装本包且没有 Npcink AI host 菜单时，打开 Tools -&gt; Site AI Abilities。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "Some abilities can prepare request payloads for a separate host or cloud add-on, but this plugin does not send those payloads to an external service by itself."
msgstr "部分 abilities 可以为独立的 host 或 cloud add-on 准备请求 payload，但这个插件本身不会把这些 payload 发送到外部服务。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "This plugin does not automatically contact Npcink AI, model providers, analytics services, tracking services, or cloud services."
msgstr "这个插件不会自动联系 Npcink AI、模型提供商、分析服务、追踪服务或云服务。"

#. Found in description paragraph.
msgid "It can be used by any WordPress plugin or client that consumes the WordPress Abilities API. Npcink AI is one optional consumer, not the owner of this plugin."
msgstr "任何消费 WordPress Abilities API 的 WordPress 插件或客户端都可以使用它。Npcink AI 是一个可选消费者，并不是这个插件的所有者。"

