#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "User-visible operator read-only mode release: site owners can turn off the write and destructive ability packages from the AI Ability Set Overview while keeping read abilities available. The narrowing-only setting composes with the host package filter, applies on the next request, is removed on uninstall, and leaves dry-run defaults and host-governed approval unchanged. The release also includes the 0.5.12 locale terminology alignment and the completed read-only implementation from #242/#243."
msgstr "面向站点管理人员的只读模式版本：站点所有者可以在 AI 能力集概览中关闭写入和破坏性能力包，同时保留读取能力。该设置只能收窄可用能力，与宿主能力包过滤器共同生效，于下次请求生效，卸载时删除，并保持默认预演和宿主治理审批不变。本版本还包含 0.5.12 的语言术语对齐以及 #242/#243 中完成的只读模式实现。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "User-experience and operator-guidance release from the 2026-10 end-user audit: no ability contract, schema, response-shape, or behavior changes to abilities. The bundled troubleshooting guide now opens with a no-command-line section for site operators and documents how to turn ability packages on or off with a copy-paste snippet, and the admin ability package list links to that guidance. A disabled safe-check button now explains that its ability is not registered instead of greying out silently, and the raw check response and raw discovery outputs gained Copy response buttons for support handoff. All admin help links share one filterable documentation base (npcink_abilities_toolkit_docs_base_url) so sites with unreliable GitHub access can point them at a mirror they maintain. Three new admin strings ship in all seven bundled locales, and this readme's description now leads with what the plugin gives you before boundary language."
msgstr "2026 年 10 月终端用户审查后的体验与管理指导版本：能力契约、输入模式、响应结构和能力行为均未改变。内置排查指南现在以无需命令行的站点管理人员说明开头，并提供关闭或启用能力包的可复制代码片段；后台能力包列表链接到该指南。无法使用的安全检查按钮会说明对应能力未注册，原始检查响应和原始发现输出增加了复制响应按钮，便于支持排查。所有后台帮助链接共用可过滤的文档基础地址（npcink_abilities_toolkit_docs_base_url），方便无法稳定访问 GitHub 的站点改用自行维护的镜像。三个新增后台文本已纳入七个内置语言包，插件说明也改为先介绍提供的用户价值，再说明职责边界。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Security and performance hardening release from the 2026-10 audit: no ability contract, schema, or response-shape changes. Publishing reports enforce per-post edit permission, anonymous frontend pageviews skip built-in ability registration and catalog fingerprinting (faster pageviews, no behavior change on admin, REST, cron, or CLI), the runtime contract endpoint serves from a bounded cache, media file paths are validated segment-by-segment on both read and write sides, every registered ability re-checks its capability before its callback runs, and site operators get a health warning when a host integration allows commits unconditionally. Uninstall now keeps the shared legacy media replacement history by default; set the npcink_abilities_toolkit_uninstall_preserve_media_history filter to false to restore the old delete behavior."
msgstr "2026 年 10 月审查后的安全与性能加固版本：能力契约、输入模式和响应结构均未改变。发布报告按文章检查编辑权限；匿名前台浏览跳过内置能力注册和目录指纹计算，以加快页面响应，后台、REST、定时任务和命令行行为不变。运行时契约端点使用有界缓存；读取和写入两侧逐段验证媒体文件路径；每个已注册能力在执行回调前重新检查权限。宿主集成无条件允许提交时，会向站点管理人员显示健康警告。卸载默认保留共享的旧版媒体替换历史；将 npcink_abilities_toolkit_uninstall_preserve_media_history 过滤器设为 false，可恢复原来的删除行为。"

#. Found in changelog paragraph.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Documentation-follow-up release: records the article-publish-preflight\nclosed-loop host proof, corrects the preflight proof failure attribution,\nand keeps the 0.5.9 code base unchanged so the conventional release tag\ncan point at the current candidate head."
msgstr "文档后续维护版本：记录文章发布预检的宿主闭环验证，纠正预检验证失败的归因，并保持 0.5.9 代码不变，让常规版本标签可以指向当前候选提交。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Bundled locales gained the workflow scenario strings and two admin strings at full template parity; a guard test keeps the hand-maintained scenario template entries from being dropped by regeneration."
msgstr "内置语言包补齐了工作流场景文本和两个后台文本，与翻译模板完全一致；保护测试防止重新生成模板时遗漏手动维护的场景条目。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Uninstalling now also removes per-admin notice state (welcome and health notice dismissals)."
msgstr "卸载现在也会删除每位管理员的通知状态，包括欢迎通知和健康通知的关闭状态。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "The admin page heading now matches the \"AI Ability Set\" menu label, overview attention notes link troubleshooting guidance, connection values explain which endpoints need an authenticated admin session, and catalog filter selects apply immediately."
msgstr "后台页面标题现在与 AI 能力集菜单名称一致，概览警告链接到排查指南，连接地址说明区分需要管理员登录的端点，目录过滤条件变更后立即生效。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "A one-time welcome notice after activation links to the ability status page and clears once the page has been visited or the notice dismissed."
msgstr "启用后的一次性欢迎通知链接到能力状态页面；访问页面或关闭通知后便不再显示。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Workflow scenario cards now follow the site language. Recipe titles and task examples are localized at render time while the discovery payloads stay untranslated contract data."
msgstr "工作流场景卡片现在使用站点语言。配方标题和自然语言任务示例在渲染时翻译，发现接口返回的契约数据仍保持原文。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "User-experience localization and onboarding release: no ability contract, schema, or behavior changes; ability ids and response shapes are identical to 0.5.8."
msgstr "用户体验、本地化与入门指导版本：能力契约、输入模式和行为不变；能力 ID 和响应结构与 0.5.8 相同。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Backfilled the bundled locales de_DE, es_ES, fr_FR, ja, ko_KR, and pt_BR to full template parity and refreshed the translation template to 0.5.7."
msgstr "补齐 de_DE、es_ES、fr_FR、ja、ko_KR 和 pt_BR 内置语言包，使其与模板完全一致，并将翻译模板更新为 0.5.7。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Kept the packaged plugin error-free for Plugin Check by routing the uninstall backup-tree file deletion through the WordPress file API."
msgstr "卸载时通过 WordPress 文件 API 删除备份目录树中的文件，使打包插件继续通过 Plugin Check 且无错误。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Improved the admin surface: a read-only ability packages overview section, explicit empty states, copy-button failure fallback, request buttons that disable while running, and translated page title registration."
msgstr "改进后台页面：提供只读能力包概览、明确的空状态、复制失败提示、请求期间禁用按钮，以及翻译后的页面标题。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Hardened the runtime contract endpoint: <code>ability_catalog_available</code> now reflects the live Abilities API route, and the contract response serves a quoted sha256 ETag with a filterable <code>Cache-Control</code> (default <code>private, no-cache</code>) plus empty 304 responses for matching <code>If-None-Match</code> polls."
msgstr "加固运行时契约端点：<code>ability_catalog_available</code> 现在反映实际 Abilities API 路由状态；契约响应提供带引号的 sha256 ETag、可过滤的 <code>Cache-Control</code>（默认为 <code>private, no-cache</code>），并对匹配 <code>If-None-Match</code> 的轮询返回无内容的 304 响应。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Shipped the user-experience hardening batch: direct post-meta write abilities now invalidate the bounded read cache instead of serving stale reports, admin health notices fail loud when ability registration is unavailable or the catalog is empty, and uninstall removes media replacement history and the plugin backups directory behind explicit preserve filters."
msgstr "交付用户体验加固：直接写入文章元数据的能力会使有界读取缓存失效，避免返回过期报告；能力无法注册或目录为空时，后台健康通知明确报告问题；卸载时可通过显式保留过滤器决定是否删除媒体替换历史和插件备份目录。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Streamlined the development workflow: a fast ~25-second iteration test tier, a mechanical post-merge steady-state check, an archived documentation library with an evergreen index, and Dependabot maintenance pull requests that are no longer blocked by the human-oriented PR body contract."
msgstr "简化开发流程：约 25 秒的快速迭代测试、机械化合并后稳态检查、具有长期入口的文档归档库，以及不再受人工 PR 正文契约阻塞的 Dependabot 维护请求。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Removed provably dead null-coalescing fallbacks in read paths (runtime-identical) while deliberately keeping the defensive fallbacks on filterable WordPress surfaces and partial-object inputs."
msgstr "删除读取路径中已证明无效的空值合并兜底，保持运行时行为不变，同时有意保留可过滤 WordPress 接口和不完整对象输入所需的防御性兜底。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Added automated debt ratchets: file-size ceilings on source modules, a repository-wide static-analysis total that only moves downward at release time, and a conservation rule so relocated static-analysis findings are never misread as new debt."
msgstr "增加自动债务棘轮：源代码文件行数上限、仅在发布时下调的仓库静态分析总量，以及防止把迁移的静态分析发现误算成新增债务的守恒规则。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Split the largest media read module into smaller trait files with byte-for-byte purity proofs and test-suite ownership assertions, keeping the class surface unchanged while making future media reads easier to review."
msgstr "将最大的媒体读取模块拆为较小的 trait 文件，以字节一致性证明和测试套件归属断言保持类接口不变，同时降低今后媒体读取改动的审查成本。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Maintenance and repository-health release: no ability contract, schema, or behavior changes; ability ids and response shapes are identical to 0.5.7."
msgstr "维护与仓库健康版本：能力契约、输入模式和行为不变；能力 ID 和响应结构与 0.5.7 相同。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Added canonical media fingerprints and replacement lineage to governed media operations."
msgstr "为受治理的媒体操作增加规范化媒体指纹和替换沿袭证据。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Required semantic body evidence for internal-link candidates and kept final application in the visible editor."
msgstr "内部链接候选必须具有正文语义证据，最终应用仍通过可见编辑器交接。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Aligned cleanup cron registration with the enabled write package and cleared it during uninstall."
msgstr "清理定时任务注册与已启用的写入能力包对齐，并在卸载时清除计划。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Added bounded media backup retention cleanup and preserved exact-manifest batch backups until explicit operator confirmation."
msgstr "增加有界媒体备份保留清理，并在操作人员明确确认前保留精确清单批次备份。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Isolate the packaged Plugin Check regression test from inherited local WordPress CLI runtime settings."
msgstr "隔离打包 Plugin Check 回归测试，使其不受继承的本地 WordPress 命令行运行时设置影响。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Backfilled the bundled zh_CN locale to full parity."
msgstr "补齐内置 zh_CN 语言包，使其与模板完全一致。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Added ability response-shape registration and scope-semantics contract drift gates."
msgstr "增加能力响应结构注册和作用域语义的契约漂移检查。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Documented the host-agnostic Host Approval Contract for governing write and destructive commits."
msgstr "记录与具体宿主无关的宿主审批契约，用于治理写入和破坏性操作的提交。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Added five machine-readable workflow recipes (article-production, media-seo-handoff, media-governance-scan, site-operations-scan, diagnostics-triage) with replay-fixture locks."
msgstr "增加五个机器可读工作流配方：article-production、media-seo-handoff、media-governance-scan、site-operations-scan 和 diagnostics-triage，并配有回放夹具锁定。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Restructured the admin tools page into two audience tabs: a one-screen Overview for site owners and task-based sub navigation for developers."
msgstr "将后台工具页面重组为面向两类读者的标签页：供站点所有者一屏查看的概览，以及供开发者按任务使用的子导航。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Fixed <code>rename-media-file</code> commits, which previously failed after copying and discarded the copied file, and corrected expired-backup cleanup history timing."
msgstr "修复 <code>rename-media-file</code> 提交此前复制后失败并丢弃副本的问题，并纠正过期备份清理历史的记录时机。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Removed the incomplete bundled Traditional Chinese starter locale until it can be maintained as a complete pack."
msgstr "暂时移除不完整的内置繁体中文初始语言包，直到能够作为完整语言包维护。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Added internal autoloading, lazy package construction, and a cold-bootstrap performance budget."
msgstr "增加内部自动加载、能力包延迟构造和冷启动性能预算。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Validated remote media before uploads, removed the obsolete in-memory fallback, and redacted reversible setting fragments."
msgstr "在写入上传目录前验证远程媒体，移除过时的内存兜底，并对可逆的设置片段进行脱敏。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Restricted post-meta reads to explicit non-sensitive keys and required host allowlists for setting patch targets."
msgstr "将文章元数据读取限制为显式提供的非敏感键，并要求设置补丁目标具备宿主允许列表。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Made write and destructive callbacks fail safe unless commit intent is explicit and host-governed."
msgstr "写入和破坏性回调默认安全拒绝实际变更，除非提交意图明确且由宿主治理。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Replaced the raw ability-count gate with representative contract assertions and documented WordPress Core convergence rules."
msgstr "用代表性契约断言替代原始能力数量门禁，并记录与 WordPress Core 能力的收敛规则。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Made Toolkit the canonical owner of reusable static workflow definitions without adding workflow runtime state."
msgstr "将 Toolkit 确立为可复用静态工作流定义的规范所有者，不引入工作流运行时状态。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Corrected the minimum WordPress version to 6.9 and added a real minimum-version release smoke."
msgstr "将最低 WordPress 版本纠正为 6.9，并增加真实最低版本发布冒烟检查。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Documented the foundation-layer testing strategy and default local source gate."
msgstr "记录 foundation-layer testing strategy 和默认本地 source gate。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Upgraded GitHub Actions checkout to the Node 24-compatible <code>actions/checkout@v5</code>."
