msgstr "添加 bundled translation templates 和八个 starter locale packs，覆盖后台 connection/discovery surface、API ability labels/descriptions 和常见 runtime error messages。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Improved the admin page as a connection and discovery surface with clearer package status, catalog navigation, copyable REST endpoints, and two bounded read-only checks."
msgstr "改进后台页面，让它成为更清晰的 connection 和 discovery surface，包含 package status、catalog navigation、可复制 REST endpoints 和两个有边界的只读 checks。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Added migrated WordPress read abilities, deterministic comment helpers, host-governed write/destructive abilities, and standalone redacted WordPress diagnostics."
msgstr "添加迁移后的 WordPress read abilities、deterministic comment helpers、host-governed write/destructive abilities，以及 standalone redacted WordPress diagnostics。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Verified WordPress REST coverage and Npcink AI consumer split-boundary checks."
msgstr "验证 WordPress REST coverage 和 Npcink AI consumer split-boundary checks。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
