msgid "Added package and sub-pack filters so hosts can keep a full catalog by default or opt into a light <code>core_wordpress_read</code> profile."
msgstr "添加 package 和 sub-pack filters，让 host 可以默认保留完整 catalog，或选择轻量 <code>core_wordpress_read</code> profile。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
#, gp-priority: low
msgid "Added a consumer example for preparing Core proposal payloads from discovered ability contracts."
msgstr "添加从已发现 ability contracts 准备 Core proposal payloads 的 consumer example。"

#. Found in changelog list item.
