#. Prepared for the 0.7.0 stable readme refresh.
msgid "Restores ability discovery on real REST requests while preserving the light anonymous frontend and operator read-only mode. Adds a read-only flagged-media removal plan and a separate governed attachment deletion ability with explicit no-backup or retained-backup branches. Host approval is required for every deletion or restore. Toolkit backups can recreate a deleted attachment with a new id; old references and plugin-specific relationships require separate review. Ten new runtime strings ship in all seven bundled locales."
msgstr "修复真实 REST 请求中的能力发现，同时保留轻量匿名前台和管理人员只读模式。增加只读的已标记媒体移除计划，以及独立的受治理附件删除能力，明确区分不保留备份和保留备份两个分支。每次删除或恢复均需宿主批准。Toolkit 备份可以用新的附件 ID 重新创建已删除附件；旧引用和插件特有关系需另行审阅。十个新增运行时文本已纳入全部七个内置语言包。"

#. Prepared for the 0.7.0 stable readme refresh.
msgid "Uninstalling removes the plugin's stored options, per-admin notice state (welcome and health notice dismissals), the media backup cleanup schedule, and backup files and deletion manifests stored by this plugin. Shared legacy media replacement history is preserved by default. Expiring transients are left to their normal lifecycle. Hosts can preserve backup files and their deletion manifests with <code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_uninstall_preserve_media_backups</code>, or explicitly remove shared history with <code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_uninstall_preserve_media_history</code> set to false."
msgstr "卸载会删除插件保存的选项、每位管理员的通知状态（欢迎通知和健康通知的关闭状态）、媒体备份清理计划，以及本插件保存的备份文件和删除清单。共享的旧版媒体替换历史默认保留，临时缓存仍按正常生命周期过期。宿主可以通过 <code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_uninstall_preserve_media_backups</code> 保留备份文件和对应删除清单，或将 <code>npcink_abilities_toolkit_uninstall_preserve_media_history</code> 设为 false，显式删除共享历史。"
